dule__Nt2Yba__rectangle \" aria-label=\"Advertisement\"><span class=\"ZadAdSlot-module__Nt2Yba__label\">ADVERTISEMENT</span><div class=\"ZadAdSlot-module__Nt2Yba__unit\"></div></aside></div></div></section><div class=\"ZadArticle-module__nhYrha__wrap\"><div class=\"ZadArticle-module__nhYrha__layout\"><article class=\"ZadArticle-module__nhYrha__article\" id=\"article-content\"><figure class=\"ZadArticle-module__nhYrha__image\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open image fullscreen\"><img src=\"/media/ramen/01c6903abb7c1d50.webp\" alt=\"Co-op and solo play guide official artwork\"/></button></figure><section id=\"section-1\"><h2>Plan jobs around the shop loop</h2><p>Fixed roles are not announced. Divide preparation, cooking, serving and cleanup, then adjust around the orders you see.</p></section><section id=\"section-2\"><h2>Solo players can hire help</h2><p>Wild Dog says hired part-time staff can support solo play. Specific abilities and costs have not been announced.</p></section><section id=\"sources\"><h2>Official sources</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://wilddog.jp/japaneseramensimulator\">Wild Dog — Japanese Ramen Simulator official site</a></li><li><a href=\"https://prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/p/000000007.000159372.html\">Wild Dog press release — 21 August 2026</a></li><li><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4968640/Japanese_Ramen_Simulator/\">Steam — Japanese Ramen Simulator</a></li></ul></section><section><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/ramen-simulator-guide\">Japanese Ramen Simulator beginner guide</a></li><li><a href=\"/ramen-simulator-shop\">Shop layout and customization</a></li></ul></section></article><aside class=\"ZadArticle-module__nhYrha__aside\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#section-1\">Plan jobs around the shop loop<span>→</span></a><a href=\"#section-2\">Solo players can hire help<span>→</span></a><a href=\"#sources\">Official sources<span>→</span></a></aside></div></div></main><section class=\"ZadArcheryHome-module__a950zq__faq\" 